  "rules": [
   "baseline: 15min CISD closure at a POI \u2014 extreme = bar below its 2 prior lows and the lowest low of the prior 20 bars (mirror for highs); level = open of the first candle of the opposing series; first close beyond it within 10 candles, no new extreme first",
